        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 16, 8 Inch Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 8\" Center to Center (CTC)  door pull is made from 3/4\" diameter solid round bar stock. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store front doors. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-16_size.gif?v=1704354604\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 16 Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/5-1-2-inch-door-pull-3-4-inch-diameter-don-jo-14\"><b>5-1/2\" Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/6-inch-door-pull-3-4-inch-diameter-don-jo-15\"><b>6\" Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/10-inch-door-pull-3-4-inch-diameter-don-jo-17\"><b>10\" Door Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of 4 different materials in 5 finish choices:<br>\r\n*Solid Aluminum: Clear Anodized Aluminum finish.<br>\r\n*Solid Brass: Polished Brass finish.<br>\r\n*Solid Bronze: Oil Rubbed Bronze finish.<br>\r\n*Solid Stainless Steel: Polished Stainless Steel or Satin Stainless Steel finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo 16 8\" Commercial Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Bar Stock</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/16.pdf?v=1704262236\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 16 Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "8 Inch Door Pull, 3/4 Inch Diameter, Don-Jo 16",
                "description": "Don-Jo 16 8 Inch Commercial Door Pulls. 3/4 inch diameter x 8 inch Center to Center (CTC) Commercial Door Pulls. Available in your choice of 5 different finish colors.",
